<title>INDIA: Indian sugar prices steady on poor demand.</title>
<headline>Indian sugar prices steady on poor demand.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sugar prices were steady on dull demand on Thursday, traders said.</p>
<p>In ready delivery, S-30 was steady at 1,345/1,375 rupees per quintal and M-30 at 1,385/1,460 rupees per quintal.</p>
<p>Sugar mill delivery was unquoted.</p>
<p>&quot;Market sentiment is slightly subdued. It should improve,&quot; said a trader.</p>
<p>-Bombay Commodities +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
